This was a project that was done indiviually through R in which we had to scrape some data from a website of our choice and then be able to continue to
do analysis on that work.  

The the project that I worked on was attempting to see if there is a way that you can predict a single national champion, or finding the 
  parameters for the national champion contenders for NCAA men's basketball.  Off of that I also looked into the different conferences and seeing 
  if there are any trends that I would be able to find that would help show the teams that you should pick to go far in your bracket. 

Attached within this folder is the code that I used for the project, alongside the project paper that I created to summarize my thoughts. 
  
